{
    "title": "iCollect Comic Books",
    "description": "iCollect Comic Books is the #1 app on the Google Play Store for managing your comic book collection and inventory, whether at home, work, or school. This app works on all device sizes and syncs directly with our Android, iPhone, iPad, and Mac apps. Scan in or search within our database for any comic you own or want and add them to your lists. Full of incredible features!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Manage and inventory any comic book from publishers such as Marvel, DC, Image, IDW, Dark Horse, Boom Studios, Dynamic Entertainment, Titan, and more!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Loaded with millions of comics from around the world in our database.\r\n\u2022 Full barcode scanning and database search.\r\n\u2022 Cloud Backup\r\n\u2022 Sync across multiple devices, including Android, iPad, iPhone, and Mac\r\n\u2022 Supports input in any language and allows selections of any country and currency.\r\n\u2022 Filters, sorting, and importing.\r\n\u2022 Three different custom layouts.\r\n\u2022 Exporting\r\n\u2022 Multi-level sorting\r\n\u2022 Shake to Select\r\n\u2022 Default Field Data\r\n\u2022 Customize which fields are displayed\r\n\u2022 Section Counts\r\n\u2022 Share your comic collection with friends or on social media like Facebook and Twitter.\r\n\u2022 Format your Titles with A, An, or The removed.\r\n\u2022 Extra features like colored Themes, Dark Mode support, and more.\r\n\u2022 Every field is editable.\r\n\u2022 Store up to four pictures per comic, including front, back, and inside images of comics.\r\n\u2022 Personal details per comic including Loaned, Purchase Price, Purchase Date, Date Added, Personal Rating, Storage Location, Opened, Notes, Estimated Value, and more.\r\n\u2022 Index bars and search for quick access in large comic collections.\r\n\r\nThis app is a completely new collecting experience written from the ground up with Kotlin. It has full Android 14 support for the latest devices from Samsung, Google, and more. Our app was created with a cloud database backend designed specifically to allow each comic to be stored with its own individual attributes.\r\n\r\nWe can import your comic book collection from nearly anywhere: CLZ Comics, Delicious Library, BookBuddy, and much more. Just send us your import file and we'll get you rolling.\r\n\r\nLarge comic book collections require an in-app purchase to unlock unlimited storage.",
    "descriptionHTML": "iCollect Comic Books is the #1 app on the Google Play Store for managing your comic book collection and inventory, whether at home, work, or school. This app works on all device sizes and syncs directly with our Android, iPhone, iPad, and Mac apps. Scan in or search within our database for any comic you own or want and add them to your lists. Full of incredible features!<br><br>\u2022 Manage and inventory any comic book from publishers such as Marvel, DC, Image, IDW, Dark Horse, Boom Studios, Dynamic Entertainment, Titan, and more!<br><br>\u2022 Loaded with millions of comics from around the world in our database.<br>\u2022 Full barcode scanning and database search.<br>\u2022 Cloud Backup<br>\u2022 Sync across multiple devices, including Android, iPad, iPhone, and Mac<br>\u2022 Supports input in any language and allows selections of any country and currency.<br>\u2022 Filters, sorting, and importing.<br>\u2022 Three different custom layouts.<br>\u2022 Exporting<br>\u2022 Multi-level sorting<br>\u2022 Shake to Select<br>\u2022 Default Field Data<br>\u2022 Customize which fields are displayed<br>\u2022 Section Counts<br>\u2022 Share your comic collection with friends or on social media like Facebook and Twitter.<br>\u2022 Format your Titles with A, An, or The removed.<br>\u2022 Extra features like colored Themes, Dark Mode support, and more.<br>\u2022 Every field is editable.<br>\u2022 Store up to four pictures per comic, including front, back, and inside images of comics.<br>\u2022 Personal details per comic including Loaned, Purchase Price, Purchase Date, Date Added, Personal Rating, Storage Location, Opened, Notes, Estimated Value, and more.<br>\u2022 Index bars and search for quick access in large comic collections.<br><br>This app is a completely new collecting experience written from the ground up with Kotlin. It has full Android 14 support for the latest devices from Samsung, Google, and more. Our app was created with a cloud database backend designed specifically to allow each comic to be stored with its own individual attributes.<br><br>We can import your comic book collection from nearly anywhere: CLZ Comics, Delicious Library, BookBuddy, and much more. Just send us your import file and we&#39;ll get you rolling.<br><br>Large comic book collections require an in-app purchase to unlock unlimited storage.",
